{
  "_comment": [
    "Manifest form of build_snake_patch.py: the same six blobs, eight data items and eleven splices, at",
    "the same addresses. Build with tools/src/dm32_patch_tools/build_manifest_patch.py. It reproduces",
    "progmem_SNAKE_patched.bin byte for byte (see that script's --compare). The WHY for every address",
    "is in build_snake_patch.py's comments and HISTORY.md, so it is not repeated here."
  ],
  "name": "snake",
  "description": "Snake as an 11th top-level menu category with a one-item sub-list (v12+ design).",
  "output_image": "progmem_SNAKE_patched.bin",
